Transform the actual source's communicative purpose in the target locale while preserving product facts, conditions, uncertainty and obligations. Use the scoped concept/sense decisions and retain necessary grammatical inflections. Reorder protected tokens as grammar requires without changing their identities or multiplicities. Preserve unresolved source meaning as a question rather than burying it in fluent text. Return a versioned candidate linked to this context and glossary edition.
